        "original_id": "93186993-998d-5849-aa3e-66f19f1e3f12",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amybeth McNulty, Lucy Maud Montgomery, Moira Walley-Beckett, Dalila Bela\n- Products: Anne, Anne with an E, Anne of Green Gables, Odd Squad\n- Organizations: CBC, Netflix, PBS Kids\n- Topics: television adaptation, acting roles\n\nFacts:\n- In 1908, Lucy Maud Montgomery published the novel \"Anne of Green Gables.\"\n- The Canadian television series \"Anne,\" titled \"Anne with an E\" on Netflix, is based on Lucy Maud Montgomery’s 1908 novel \"Anne of Green Gables.\"\n- Moira Walley-Beckett adapted the television series \"Anne\" and is an Emmy Award-winning writer and producer.\n- In 2017, Amybeth McNulty starred as Anne Shirley in the CBC/Netflix series \"Anne.\"\n- Dalila Bela, born on October 5, 2001, is a Canadian actress.\n- Dalila Bela is known for playing Agent Olive on the PBS Kids series \"Odd Squad\" and for work on the television shows \"Once Upon a Time\" and \"Anne.\"",
